<title>HUNGARY: Hungary elec rise recommendation 23.5pct, gas 16.4.</title>
<headline>Hungary elec rise recommendation 23.5pct, gas 16.4.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government commissioner who reviews pricing policy will recommend consumer price rises in January of 23.5 percent for electricity and 16.4 percent for gas, a spokesman for Electricite de France (EdF) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The commissioner, Imre Karl, said he was recommending 23.5 and 16.4 percent to the government tomorrow,&quot; EdF's manager for Hungary Pierre Abou told Reuters.</p>
</text>
